  "title": "One Bowl Lemon Cupcakes",
  "description": "Based on &#39;One Bowl Chocolate Cake,&#39; this recipe delivers fluffy and moist lemon cupcakes from batter achieved in one bowl.",
  "authors": [
    "Dani"
  ],
